help_hosts_block:
🖥 *Several hosts:* add `@<host>` to aim a command at one of them, `@all` at every one — e.g. `/check @nas` or `/update sonarr @nas`.
Without an `@`: `/check`, `/status` and `/updates` look at every host; `/update`, `/start`, `/stop` and `/restart` act on the local host only.
